2026-07-27T10:57:35.7885748Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T10:57:35.7946104Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:57:35.7946732Z i /tmp/Rtmp6PSWng/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:57:35.7947204Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:57:35.7947722Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:57:35.7948168Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:57:35.7948650Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:57:35.7949314Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:57:35.7950122Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
